# Discover is the first screen and starts with a compact section index. Curated
# Constellations and Jeunesse lists come first, and books appear only after a
# section is opened.
clean
expect Prêt numérique
expect Browse sections
expect Constellations
expect Jeunesse
expect Recent releases
expect Page 1 of 2
expect Previous page
expect Next page
tap Next page
wait-for Littérature queer
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Constellations
clean
tap Recent releases
wait-for Filters
expect Recent releases
# Books are now on the browse screen, where the title and author can take the
# room they need.
expect J. Boisvert +4
expect-missing Pierrette Dubé
clean
expect Page 1
tap Next page
wait-for Page 2
clean
tap Previous page
wait-for Page 1
clean
tap Mensonges
wait-for Book details
# The book screen exposes each library as the actionable borrow/reserve row.
expect Montréal · Borrow
clean
